ATMEGA_328P
PB0 Soft_SPI_MOSI -> software spi for leds
PB1 Soft_SPI_CLK -> software spi for leds
PB2 SPI_SS
PB3 SPI_MOSI
PB4 SPI_MISO
PB5 SPI_CLK
