PB7 XTAL2

PC0 32U4_SS -> 32u4 slave select
PC1 EXP1_INTA -> expansor 1 interrupt A
PC2 EXP1_INTB -> expansor 1 interrupt B
PC3 EXP2_INTA -> expansor 2 interrupt A
PC4 I2C_SDA
PC5 I2C_SCL
PC6 -

PD0 EXP2_INTB -> expansor 2 interrupt B
PD1 DMUX_OUT -> digital mux out
PD2 32U4_INT -> interrupt line to call 32u4
PD3 DISPLAY_CS -> display chip select
PD4 MUX_S3 -> muxs select line 3 (select lines are shared between analog and digital muxs)
PD5 MUX_S0 -> muxs select line 0
PD6 MUX_S1 -> muxs select line 1
PD7 MUX_S2 -> muxs select line 2

ADC6 -
ADC7 AMUX_OUT -> analog mux out
